  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voter Outreach for Transparent Elections - Fiji (VOTE-Fiji)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to fortify the Fijian Elections Office (FEO), on the basis that a more transparent process, more aware and involved voters, combined with a stronger gender-sensitive approach, will enhance future electoral processes including local government and national elections. Rooted in structural challenges, it strives for a representative and inclusive democracy, acknowledging and addressing societal and cultural barriers. Building on successful collaborations during the 2022 General Ele</narrative>
  </description>
